      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "formData": {
          "textContent": [
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "type1",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "title",
              "value": "Beans & Glory Event Guide"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "📅 Event Period: June 12 – June 23, 2025\nThe Beans & Glory event includes two parts: Daily Tasks and Ranking Challenges\n • Daily Tasks: June 12 – June 23\n • Ranking Event:\n • Stage 1: Sprint Stage (June 12 – June 16)\n • Stage 2: Champion Stage (June 16 – June 23)"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "✅ Participation:\nOnly selected and successfully signed-up hosts can join.\nOnly beans received from the following regions will be counted:\nUnited Kingdom, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand, United States, and Canada"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🎯 Daily Task Rules:\n • Each host can unlock up to 5 reward tiers per day\n • Rewards are cumulative; multiple tiers can be unlocked on the same day\n • Estimated max daily reward: 9600 beans\n • Beans collected are reset daily and do not carry over"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "⚠️ Notes:\n • Task levels are non-cumulative. For example, if you complete Lv.1 (1,000 beans), you then need to collect an additional 2,000 beans to unlock Lv.2 (total 3,000)\n • Rewards are limited. Once the quota for a tier is full, no rewards will be given, even if the task is completed. No notifications will be sent"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🏆 Ranking Overview:\nSprint Stage and Champion Stage are separate. Scores do not carry over.\nHosts may choose to join one or both stages"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🎁 Reward Distribution:\n • Daily task rewards will be sent instantly once the host hits the target (while the quota remains). \n • Due to a system upgrade, rewards earned from June 12 to June 16 will be recorded and distributed gradually between June 17 and 18.\n • Starting from June 18, all rewards will be issued immediately upon task completion.\n • Ranking rewards will be sent within 5–7 working days after the event ends"
            }
          ]
        },
        "complete": true,
